10 |     estimator : estimator object\n311 |         The estimator from which to get the tag.\n312 | \n313 |     Returns\n314 |     -------\n315 |     tags : :class:`~.sklearn.utils.Tags`\n316 |         The estimator tags.\n317 |     \"\"\"\n318 | \n319 |     if hasattr(estimator, \"__sklearn_tags__\"):\n320 |         tags = estimator.__sklearn_tags__()\n321 |     else:\n322 |         warnings.warn(\n323 |             f\"Estimator {estimator} has no __sklearn_tags__ attribute, which is \"\n324 |             \"defined in `sklearn.base.BaseEstimator`. This will raise an error in \"\n325 |             \"scikit-learn 1.8. Please define the __sklearn_tags__ method, or inherit \"\n326 |             \"from `sklearn.base.BaseEstimator` and other appropriate mixins such as \"\n327 |             \"`sklearn.base.TransformerMixin`, `sklearn.base.ClassifierMixin`, \"\n328 |             \"`sklearn.base.RegressorMixin`, and `sklearn.base.ClusterMixin`, and \"\n329 |             \"`sklearn.base.OutlierMixin`.\",\n330 |             category=FutureWarning,\n331 |         )\n332 |         tags = default_tags(estimator)\n333 | \n334 |     return tags\n```\n\n\n\n##Searching for term \"_get_tags\", \"_more_tags\", \"safe_tags\"...\n### Search Result:\nFound function `sklearn/multiclass.py:OneVsRestClassifier.__sklearn_tags__`.\nSource: Retrieved entity using keyword search (bm25).\n```\n600 | def __sklearn_tags__(self):\n601 |         \"\"\"Indicate if wrapped estimator is using a precomputed Gram matrix\"\"\"\n602 |         tags = super().__sklearn_tags__()\n603 |         tags.input_tags.pairwise = get_tags(self.estimator).input_tags.pairwise\n604 |         return tags\n```\n\nFound function `sklearn/multiclass.py:OneVsOneClassifier.__sklearn_tags__`.\nSource: Retrieved entity using keyword search (bm25).\n```\n1003 | def __sklearn_tags__(self):\n1004 |         \"\"\"Indicate if wrapped estimator is using a precomputed Gram matrix\"\"\"\n1005 |         tags = super().__sklearn_tags__()