u2500 sklearn/decomposition/_nmf.py:MiniBatchNMF.partial_fit\n\u2502                 \u251c\u2500\u2500 invokes-by \u2500\u2500 sklearn/decomposition/_sparse_pca.py:_BaseSparsePCA.fit\n\u2502                 \u251c\u2500\u2500 invokes-by \u2500\u2500 sklearn/decomposition/_sparse_pca.py:_BaseSparsePCA.transform\n\u2502                 \u251c\u2500\u2500 invokes-by \u2500\u2500 sklearn/decomposition/_kernel_pca.py:KernelPCA.fit\n\u2502                 \u251c\u2500\u2500 invokes-by \u2500\u2500 sklearn/decomposition/_kernel_pca.py:KernelPCA.transform\n\u2502                 \u251c\u2500\u2500 invokes-by \u2500\u2500 sklearn/decomposition/_incremental_pca.py:IncrementalPCA.fit\n\u2502                 \u251c\u2500\u2500 invokes-by \u2500\u2500 sklearn/decomposition/_incremental_pca.py:IncrementalPCA.partial_fit\n\u2502                 \u251c\u2500\u2500 invokes-by \u2500\u2500 sklearn/decomposition/_fastica.py:FastICA._fit_transform\n\u2502                 \u251c\u2500\u2500 invokes-by \u2500\u2500 sklearn/decomposition/_fastica.py:FastICA.transform\n\u2502                 \u251c\u2500\u2500 invokes-by \u2500\u2500 sklearn/decomposition/_pca.py:PCA._fit\n\u2502                 \u251c\u2500\u2500 invokes-by \u2500\u2500 sklearn/decomposition/_pca.py:PCA.score_samples\n\u2502                 \u251c\u2500\u2500 invokes-by \u2500\u2500 sklearn/decomposition/_truncated_svd.py:TruncatedSVD.fit_transform\n\u2502                 \u251c\u2500\u2500 invokes-by \u2500\u2500 sklearn/decomposition/_truncated_svd.py:TruncatedSVD.transform\n\u2502                 \u251c\u2500\u2500 invokes-by \u2500\u2500 sklearn/decomposition/_dict_learning.py:_BaseSparseCoding._transform\n\u2502                 \u251c\u2500\u2500 invokes-by \u2500\u2500 sklearn/decomposition/_dict_learning.py:DictionaryLearning.fit_transform\n\u2502                 \u251c\u2500\u2500 invokes-by \u2500\u2500 sklearn/decomposition/_dict_learning.py:MiniBatchDictionaryLearning.fit\n\u2502                 \u251c\u2500\u