3302 |     # Test for no setting apart from parameters during init\n3303 |     invalid_attr = set(vars(estimator)) - set(init_params) - set(parents_init_params)\n3304 |     # Ignore private attributes\n3305 |     invalid_attr = set([attr for attr in invalid_attr if not attr.startswith(\"_\")])\n3306 |     assert not invalid_attr, (\n3307 |         \"Estimator %s should not set any attribute apart\"\n3308 |         \" from parameters during init. Found attributes %s.\"\n3309 |         % (name, sorted(invalid_attr))\n3310 |     )\n```\n"}, {"content": "Let's explore the repository structure starting from utils directory since it seems most relevant to documentation validation:\n\n<function=explore_tree_structure>\n<parameter=start_entities>['sklearn/utils']</parameter>\n<parameter=direction>both</parameter>\n<parameter=traversal_depth>2</parameter>\n", "role": "assistant", "tool_calls": null, "function_call": null}, {"role": "tool", "tool_call_id": "toolu_01", "name": "explore_tree_structure", "content": "OBSERVATION:\nsklearn/utils\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 contains \u2500\u2500 sklearn/utils/optimize.py\n\u2502               \u251c\u2500\u2500 contains \u2500\u2500 sklearn/utils/optimize.py:_LineSearchError\n\u2502               \u251c\u2500\u2500 contains \u2500\u2500 sklearn/utils/optimize.py:_line_search_wolfe12\n\u2502               \u251c\u2500\u2500 contains \u2500\u2500 sklearn/utils/optimize.py:_cg\n\u2502               \u251c\u2500\u2500 contains \u2500\u2500 sklearn/utils/optimize.py:_newton_cg\n\u2502               \u251c\u2500\u2500 contains \u2500\u2500 sklearn/utils/optimize.py:_check_optimize_result\n\u2502               \u251c\u2500\u2500 imports \u2500\u2500 sklearn/exceptions.py:ConvergenceWarning\n\u2502               \u2514\u2500\u2500 imports \u2500\u2500 sklearn/utils/fixes.py\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 contains \u2500\u2500 sklearn/utils/_missing.py\n\u2502               \u251c\u2500\u2500 contains \u2500\u2500 sklearn/utils/_missing.py:is_scalar_nan\n\u25